      "cooked": "<p>Great idea, by the way.</p>\n<p>The first point to be addressed is wether you are playing <em><strong><a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/boardgame/102652/sentinels-multiverse\">Enhanced Edition</a>:</strong></em><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2e41826f8b3ee8fa2d34b8eed2bdabfe745c9bd1.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/2e41826f8b3ee8fa2d34b8eed2bdabfe745c9bd1\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2e41826f8b3ee8fa2d34b8eed2bdabfe745c9bd1_2_340x500.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"6BcjF2xbvlGu6i92HLcRltKBSJX\" width=\"340\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2e41826f8b3ee8fa2d34b8eed2bdabfe745c9bd1_2_340x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2e41826f8b3ee8fa2d34b8eed2bdabfe745c9bd1.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2e41826f8b3ee8fa2d34b8eed2bdabfe745c9bd1.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2e41826f8b3ee8fa2d34b8eed2bdabfe745c9bd1_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">408×600 71.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Or <em><strong><a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/boardgame/335212/sentinels-multiverse-definitive-edition\">Definitive Edition</a>:</strong></em><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/dccaf81a4652cb7e8581d1e652f95bcfce768ff8.png\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/dccaf81a4652cb7e8581d1e652f95bcfce768ff8\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/dccaf81a4652cb7e8581d1e652f95bcfce768ff8.png\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"vvdTYK8isbEnj0qYbKz8bwEJLyE\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/dccaf81a4652cb7e8581d1e652f95bcfce768ff8_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">600×600 224 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>I ask because <em><strong>Definitive Edition</strong></em> has <strong>Events</strong>, which would probably help with this. Other than that, the only difference is the Hero Variants, which isn’t super important.</p>",
