      "created_at": "2022-09-12T13:06:06.917Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, some buddies of mine put this one together quite a while ago, so some of it is outdated.</p><aside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"19790\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/46a35a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/sentinels-battle-timeline/19790\">Sentinels Battle Timeline</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/games/sentinels-of-the-multiverse/11\"><span data-category-id=\"11\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #F1592A; --category-badge-text-color: #FFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #3AB54A;\" data-parent-category-id=\"73\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --has-parent\" title=\"General Discussion of Sentinels of the Multiverse.\"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">Sentinels of the Multiverse</span></span></a>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Hello all, Some of you may remember we put up an early draft of this project about a year and a half ago.&nbsp;&nbsp; \nI want to appologize for not putting up our better version sooner.&nbsp; We never compleatly finished this and my friend working on it with me moved away.&nbsp;&nbsp; \nBut I realized we had not put up the better version so I am doing so now.&nbsp; It is not perfect.&nbsp; But it is close. \n&nbsp; \nThis is our best atempt at going through all the cards, and Letters Page, and everything else we could find to list out al…\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n",
